invalid_api_key.description:
{provider} rejected CastStudio's API key on a {service} request, so briefings are using the fallback voice and text.

{provider} said: {message}

Check the key in the {provider} integration or CastStudio settings.

billing.description:
{provider} refused a {service} request because of the account's billing, so briefings are using the fallback voice and text.

{provider} said: {message}

Add credits or update billing in your {provider} account. This notice clears on the next successful request.

permission_denied.description:
{provider} denied a {service} request from CastStudio, so briefings are using the fallback voice and text.

{provider} said: {message}

Check that the API key's project has access to the model.

quota_exceeded.description:
{provider} rejected a {service} request because the account's quota or rate limit is used up, so briefings are using the fallback voice and text.

{provider} said: {message}

Wait for the quota to reset or raise it in your {provider} account. This notice clears on the next successful request.
